This repository is a modified version of the original work. Modifications
were made in November 2026 by SQR11211:

  - Ported the mod to Minecraft 26.2 / NeoForge 26.2.0.95 (Java 25).
  - Restructured the multi-loader project (common/fabric/neoforge) into a
    single NeoForge project built with NeoForge ModDevGradle.
  - Adapted and rewrote source files for the 26.2 API.
  - Replaced the upstream mixin-based implementations with NeoForge
    entity, goal, networking and client renderer implementations.
  - Added an independent BE-style Wither entity summoned with 3 Skeleton
    Skulls on Soul Sand / Soul Soil.

